From dc08c012d58feb046dd7e4e22bb1b44ceda8bc9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jurilw <washington.juri@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:05:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(composer): usage burn-rate meter

Shows how fast the selected provider's subscription quota is burning as a
multiple of the even pace: 1x spends each window's quota at exactly the
rate that reaches 100% at its reset. The button shows the hottest window;
the popover lists every window with the average since it opened, the last
30 minutes against what is left, and when the window runs out at the
current average. Accounts without quota windows (API keys, metered plans)
get no button.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
